        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2096_7855.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willig dienst, zuovor
<lb n="2"/>fürsichtigen, ersamen, und weisen,
<lb n="3"/>insonders lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Es ist diser tagen ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iunger</unclear> knab, so sich <persName resp="#ner">Chri-
<lb n="5"/>stophel <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kobel</unclear></persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-89" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Veldtkirch</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nent</unclear>, in unser <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnos</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/>schaft</orgName> und gefangenschafft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">komen</unclear>, der hat under
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekhandt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wassmassen</unclear> vor
<lb n="8"/>ungefehr 5. od 6. wuchen in E. E. W.
<lb n="9"/>statt ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">übelthäter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iustificiert</unclear> worden, den
<lb n="10"/>er <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rothlatz</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genandt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seye</unclear> auß dem landt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-8" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Abben-
<lb n="11"/>zell</placeName> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rooden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bürtig</unclear> gewesen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dene</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>habe er <persName resp="#ner">Christoph</persName>, in halber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jahrsfrist</unclear> (so lang
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seye</unclear> er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seinem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stieffvatter</unclear>, so zuo
<lb n="14"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-263" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Trogen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gericht</unclear> worden, gangen) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kühe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kalb</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bockh</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">farb</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> waldt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Saxt</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überlüpfen</unclear>, vil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wet</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/>ter helffen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbruoten</unclear>, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habe</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> kön-
<lb n="17"/>nen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsichtbar</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">klötz</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stöckh</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unvernünffti</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thieren</unclear>, als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">katzen</unclear> und dergleichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">machen</unclear>.
<lb n="19"/>Seye dergestalt eingezogen worden, so baldt
<lb n="20"/>er in die statt komen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirtzhauß</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogehn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hetten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> zween <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bettelvögt</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>und sonst noch einer angegriffen, deren er
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2096_7856.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="23"/>sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerdings</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwehrt</unclear> gehabt hette. Er
<lb n="24"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Christopb</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">damahln</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> man <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">justificiert</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">da</unclear> gewesen, und die vergicht ge=
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoerdt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemblich</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">viertzehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hannen</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">morden</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>und brand <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ueber</unclear> ihne <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgelesen</unclear>, auch er hierauf
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geredbrecht</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verbrandt</unclear> worden.
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> gefangnen solches nicht wohl
<lb n="30"/>glauben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear>, alldieweiln <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerkomen</unclear>,
<lb n="31"/>daß dergleichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ubelthaeter</unclear> in E. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="32"/>Statt, in der zeit, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethuetter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgethon</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>worden, unnd dahero gern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wißten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear>, wie
<lb n="34"/>es damit bewandt und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschaffen</unclear> seye.
<lb n="35"/>Alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelangt</unclear> an E. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuechen</unclear>, ob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deme</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">also</unclear>,
<lb n="37"/>oder nit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">avisieren</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>auch im fall <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angedeüter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ubelthaeter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgehoerter</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuergebner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eingezogen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerichtet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wor=</unclear>
<lb n="40"/>den, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßselben</unclear> vergicht, und ob er un=
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sers</unclear> gefangnen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nie</unclear> gedacht, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuekomen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zelaßten</unclear>,
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> darnach gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeverhalten</unclear>.
<lb n="43"/>Daß begeren wir in gleichem und andern
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2096_7857.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündtnachbarlich</unclear> zuerwideren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> da-
<lb n="45"/>mit samptlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwer</unclear> obhalt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wohl</unclear>-
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevehlende</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1618-05-23" resp="#ner">den 23ten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maij</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>Anno 1618</origDate>.
<lb n="48"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>der Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sannt</unclear> Gallen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2096_7858.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="50"/>Den ehrenvesten, fuersichtigen, ehrsamen und
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear> der statt
<lb n="52"/>Lindauw</orgName>, unsern insonders lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünden</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparenn</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lindauw</unclear></placeName>.
</p>
